## Acceptance checks

- The hierarchy can be explained in ordinary language.
- Users can reach the parent topic from a child.
- Topic names differ enough to make choices clear.
- The same list is not needlessly repeated in several panels.

Check the examples at narrow widths, with a keyboard and without JavaScript. Test a production implementation against its actual data and permissions before calling it supported.

